      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n4 \\sqrt{3}\\sin\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=22.5^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(45^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4 \\sqrt{3}\\sin\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)&=2 \\sqrt{3}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
